   182	but (4.1) does not make `Xbar-A2` finite.  A boundary divisor of `Xbar` can
   183	dominate a divisor of `U` that another source sheet already attains.  The
   184	reviewed Miyanishi pseudo-covering control realizes exactly this behavior by
   185	deleting affine-line boundary components above an already-attained multiple
   186	fibre.
