+`CONFIRMED` maximum-safe theorem:
+
+> Let `F=(F,G):A2_C -> A2_C` be a complex polynomial Keller map.  Then the
+> generic function-field degree satisfies
+> `[C(x,y):C(F,G)] != 3`.
